      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "question": "How do you say 'give me 3 rotis' in Hindi?",
      "options": ["mujhe do roti dena", "mujhe teen roti dena", "mujhe chaar roti dena", "mujhe ek roti dena"],
      "correctIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "'Mujhe teen roti dena' = give me 3 rotis. Mujhe = to me, teen = three, dena = give."
